# The singletons of Sol.Design, for the files in this folder. A file here
# sees the others through its own folder (the implicit import) before
# `import Sol.Design`, and a folder without this list would make Theme a
# plain component there: the first file to name it that way (Sounds, which
# loads before anything else) left Theme empty for every screen in a built
# app. build.rs refuses a build where this list and the files' `pragma
# Singleton` disagree.
singleton Format 1.0 Format.qml
singleton Notices 1.0 Notices.qml
singleton Sol 1.0 Sol.qml
singleton Sounds 1.0 Sounds.qml
singleton Theme 1.0 Theme.qml
singleton Worlds 1.0 Worlds.qml
